# TC-ViTok Architecture Diagram

This is a placeholder for the TPN architecture figure.

The diagram should illustrate:
1. Dual-stream input: coarse image (98×98) + question text
2. Frozen encoders: DINOv2-S + CLIP text
3. TPN: cross-attention + score head + bilinear upsample
4. Gumbel-Sigmoid STE: differentiable top-k selection
5. Full visual encoder: CLIP ViT-L/14 (336×336)
6. Token masking: 576 → k selected tokens
7. LLaVA with LoRA: final VQA prediction

